[00:36.09]1. What love Jehovah showed,
[00:39.64]What goodness from him flowed,
[00:45.76]When for all mankind he offered his Firstborn.
[00:51.88]Christ took on human form—
[00:55.96]The Son of man was born—
[01:00.04]By his example, God’s name he adorned.
[01:16.32]2. Jehovah’s Word, he said,
[01:20.32]Sustained his life like bread.
[01:24.32]It gave him wisdom and knowledge and insight.
[01:32.54]His Father’s willing slave,
[01:36.54]A model Jesus gave;
[01:40.54]To please his Father would bring him delight.
[03:20.35]3. Like Jesus, may our days
[03:24.43]Provide Jehovah praise,
[03:28.51]And may his footsteps become our own roadway.
[03:36.62]Let Jesus’ model be
[03:40.62]Our path eternally,
[03:44.62]And then God’s favor we’ll know day by day.